# size 16x3
# Erasing carries the background, and the oracle cannot see it at the end of a row.
#
# Blue background, four characters, home, erase to end of line, then a mark nine columns along.
# The cells between are blue: background-colour erase is on. The proof has to be a mark further
# along, because capture-pane trims a row trailing cells and reading those is what once produced
# the opposite conclusion and an emulator change in the wrong direction.
\e[44mABCD\e[H\e[K\e[1;10HZ
